@{
    Layout = null;
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>403 Forbidden - JirHub</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdfbfb 0%, #ebedee 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .error-container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            padding: 4rem 3rem;
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .error-container::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 6px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ef4444, #f59e0b);
        }
        .icon-box {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: #fef2f2;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            color: #ef4444;
            font-size: 3rem;
        }
        h1 {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1e293b;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        h2 {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        p {
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .btn-back {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .btn-back:hover {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="icon-box">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
        </div>
        <h1>403</h1>
        <h2>Truy cập bị từ chối</h2>
        <p>
            Bạn không có quyền truy cập vào chức năng hoặc trang này. 
            Vui lòng liên hệ với Quản trị viên nếu bạn cho rằng đây là một sự nhầm lẫn.
        </p>
        
        <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-back me-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Quay lại
        </a>
        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="btn-back" style="background: #2563eb;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Trang chủ
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
